{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify Online Store 2.0 section named:
    
    "Shape Carousel"
    
    Build a premium minimal jewelry shape selector section similar to the provided reference image.
    
    The main priority is:
    
    The carousel must work correctly on both desktop and mobile.
    
    Do not create a static grid.
    
    Use a real functional carousel/slider.
    
    IMPORTANT: DO NOT ADD DEFAULT CONTENT
    
    Do not add any default heading text.
    
    Do not add any default card titles.
    
    Do not add placeholder text.
    
    I will add all text manually from Shopify theme editor.
    
    Only create the structure and settings.
    
    SECTION STRUCTURE
    
    The section should contain:
    
    Optional heading block
    Carousel container
    Shape cards
    
    The merchant can add/edit all content from Shopify theme settings.
    
    DESKTOP CAROUSEL REQUIREMENTS
    
    Create a proper horizontal carousel.
    
    Desktop Layout:
    
    Display:
    
    5 cards visible at the same time
    
    Example:
    
    CARD 1 | CARD 2 | CARD 3 | CARD 4 | CARD 5
    Desktop Slider Functionality
    
    The carousel must:
    
    ✅ Work with next arrow
    ✅ Work with previous arrow
    ✅ Support mouse drag
    ✅ Support touch swipe
    ✅ Infinite loop
    ✅ Smooth sliding animation
    ✅ No blank spaces
    ✅ No broken slides
    ✅ No layout jumping
    
    When clicking next:
    
    Move only ONE card.
    
    Example:
    
    Before:
    
    1  2  3  4  5
    
    After:
    
    2  3  4  5  6
    MOBILE CAROUSEL REQUIREMENTS
    
    Mobile must have a completely different layout.
    
    Do NOT simply shrink desktop carousel.
    
    Create a mobile-specific carousel layout.
    
    Mobile Card Layout
    
    Show:
    
    2 columns × 2 rows
    
    Example:
    {
    -----------------
    | Card 1 | Card 2 |
    -----------------
    | Card 3 | Card 4 |
    -----------------
    }
    This group of 4 cards is one slide.
    
    Mobile Slider Movement
    
    IMPORTANT:
    
    Move FOUR cards together.
    
    Example:
    
    Slide 1:
    
    Card 1   Card 2
    
    Card 3   Card 4
    
    Next slide:
    
    Card 5   Card 6
    
    Card 7   Card 8
    
    Do NOT:
    
    ❌ Move one card at a time
    ❌ Show one row only
    ❌ Create horizontal scrolling
    ❌ Break the 2x2 layout
    
    MOBILE CAROUSEL FUNCTION
    
    Mobile must support:
    
    ✅ Touch swipe
    ✅ Next/previous navigation
    ✅ Infinite loop
    ✅ Smooth transition
    ✅ Pagination dots
    ✅ Proper spacing
    ✅ Fixed card layout
    
    CARD DESIGN
    
    Create simple luxury-style cards.
    
    No effects.
    
    No animation.
    
    No shadows.
    
    No zoom.
    
    No hover scaling.
    
    Card Appearance
    
    Card:
    
    Clean white/light background
    Minimal design
    Center aligned image
    Text area below image (empty by default)
    IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    Each card should support:
    
    Image upload
    Optional hover image upload
    
    Image rules:
    
    ✅ Maintain original image ratio
    ✅ No forced square image
    ✅ No cropping
    ✅ No stretching
    ✅ Use object-fit: contain
    
    Image size should be adjustable.
    
    CARD SETTINGS
    
    Maximum cards:
    
    12
    
    Only display cards that have images uploaded.
    
    If merchant adds:
    
    5 cards → show 5 cards
    
    If merchant adds:
    
    12 cards → show 12 cards
    
    CARD CUSTOMIZATION SETTINGS
    
    Add theme editor controls:
    
    Desktop:
    Card width
    Card height
    Image size
    Gap between cards
    Mobile:
    
    Separate controls:
    
    Card width
    Card height
    Image size
    Gap between cards
    HEADING SETTINGS
    
    Create optional heading block.
    
    Settings:
    
    Heading text field
    Font family
    Font size
    Font weight
    Letter spacing
    Line height
    Color
    Alignment
    
    Desktop alignment:
    
    Center
    
    Mobile alignment:
    
    Center
    
    SPACING SETTINGS
    
    Create separate padding controls.
    
    Desktop Section Padding:
    Top
    Bottom
    Left
    Right
    Mobile Section Padding:
    Top
    Bottom
    Left
    Right
    NAVIGATION SETTINGS
    
    Desktop:
    
    Show:
    
    Previous arrow
    Next arrow
    
    Arrow style:
    
    Simple circular button
    No shadow
    No animation
    
    Mobile:
    
    Optional arrows.
    
    Primary navigation:
    
    Touch swipe + dots.
    
    PAGINATION SETTINGS
    
    Add bottom pagination.
    
    Style:
    
    Minimal dots / progress indicator.
    
    Controls:
    
    Enable/disable
    Color
    Size
    RESPONSIVE RULES
    
    Desktop:
    
    5 cards visible
    Move 1 card
    Horizontal slider
    
    Tablet:
    
    3 cards visible
    Move 1 card
    
    Mobile:
    
    2 columns
    2 rows
    4 cards visible
    Move 4 cards
    DEVELOPMENT REQUIREMENTS
    
    The carousel must:
    
    Use a real JavaScript slider
    Initialize correctly in Shopify theme editor
    Reinitialize after section reload
    Work in live storefront
    Work on iOS and Android
    Work on desktop browsers
    
    Do NOT use:
    
    ❌ CSS-only slider
    ❌ overflow scrolling
    ❌ fake carousel
    ❌ static grid pretending to be carousel
    
    FINAL OUTPUT
    
    Create a clean luxury jewelry shape carousel:
    
    ✅ Fully editable Shopify section
    ✅ No default text
    ✅ No shadows
    ✅ No zoom effects
    ✅ No hover animations
    ✅ Correct desktop carousel
    ✅ Correct mobile 2x2 grouped carousel
    ✅ Mobile moves 4 cards together
    ✅ Natural image ratio
    ✅ Minimal premium jewelry UI
    ✅ Matches the provided reference image style
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-shape-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top_desktop }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_desktop }}px;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.padding_left_desktop }}px;
    padding-right: {{ block.settings.padding_right_desktop }}px;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_margin_bottom }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.heading_line_height }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    gap: {{ block.settings.gap_desktop }}px;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: {{ block.settings.card_width_desktop }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.card_height_desktop }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_size_desktop }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hover-image {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-shape-carousel__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hover-image {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-shape-carousel__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.main-image {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.arrow_border }};
    color: {{ block.settings.arrow_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 10;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_background_hover }};
    color: {{ block.settings.arrow_color_hover }};
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}.prev {
    left: 10px;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}.next {
    right: 10px;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.pagination_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.pagination_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.pagination_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-shape-carousel__dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.pagination_active_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-shape-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
      padding-left: {{ block.settings.padding_left_mobile }}px;
      padding-right: {{ block.settings.padding_right_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-shape-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.gap_mobile }}px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .ai-shape-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: calc(50% - {{ block.settings.gap_mobile | divided_by: 2 }}px);
      height: {{ block.settings.card_height_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-shape-carousel__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: {{ block.settings.image_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-shape-carousel__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.show_arrows_mobile == false %}
        display: none;
      {% endif %}
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<shape-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-shape-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
    <h2 class="ai-shape-carousel__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-shape-carousel__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.show_arrows %}
      <button class="ai-shape-carousel__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} prev" aria-label="Previous">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </button>
      <button class="ai-shape-carousel__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} next" aria-label="Next">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </button>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-shape-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% for i in (1..12) %}
        {% assign image_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_image' %}
        {% assign hover_image_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_hover_image' %}
        {% assign text_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_text' %}
        {% assign link_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_link' %}
        
        {% assign card_image = block.settings[image_key] %}
        {% assign card_hover_image = block.settings[hover_image_key] %}
        {% assign card_text = block.settings[text_key] %}
        {% assign card_link = block.settings[link_key] %}

        {% if card_image %}
          <div class="ai-shape-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card-index="{{ i }}">
            {% if card_link != blank %}
              <a href="{{ card_link }}" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
            {% endif %}
            
            <div class="ai-shape-carousel__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="position: relative;">
              <img 
                src="{{ card_image | image_url: width: 500 }}" 
                alt="{{ card_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-shape-carousel__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} main-image"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ card_image.width }}"
                height="{{ card_image.height }}"
              >
              {% if card_hover_image %}
                <img 
                  src="{{ card_hover_image | image_url: width: 500 }}" 
                  alt="{{ card_hover_image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-shape-carousel__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} hover-image"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ card_hover_image.width }}"
                  height="{{ card_hover_image.height }}"
                >
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            
            {% if card_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-shape-carousel__text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if card_link != blank %}
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if block.settings.show_pagination %}
    <div class="ai-shape-carousel__pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
  {% endif %}
</shape-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function() {
  class ShapeCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    constructor() {
      super();
      this.currentIndex = 0;
      this.isMobile = window.innerWidth < 750;
      this.isDragging = false;
      this.startPos = 0;
      this.currentTranslate = 0;
      this.prevTranslate = 0;
      this.animationID = 0;
    }

    connectedCallback() {
      this.track = this.querySelector('.ai-shape-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      this.cards = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('.ai-shape-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}'));
      this.prevBtn = this.querySelector('.ai-shape-carousel__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}.prev');
      this.nextBtn = this.querySelector('.ai-shape-carousel__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}.next');
      this.pagination = this.querySelector('.ai-shape-carousel__pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }}');

      if (this.cards.length === 0) return;

      this.setupCarousel();
      this.setupEventListeners();
      this.updateCarousel();

      window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
        const wasMobile = this.isMobile;
        this.isMobile = window.innerWidth < 750;
        if (wasMobile !== this.isMobile) {
          this.currentIndex = 0;
          this.setupCarousel();
          this.updateCarousel();
        }
      });
    }

    setupCarousel() {
      if (this.isMobile) {
        this.cardsPerSlide = 4;
        this.totalSlides = Math.ceil(this.cards.length / this.cardsPerSlide);
      } else {
        this.cardsPerSlide = 1;
        this.totalSlides = this.cards.length;
      }

      if (this.pagination) {
        this.pagination.innerHTML = '';
        for (let i = 0; i < this.totalSlides; i++) {
          const dot = document.createElement('div');
          dot.className = 'ai-shape-carousel__dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
          dot.addEventListener('click', () => this.goToSlide(i));
          this.pagination.appendChild(dot);
        }
      }
    }

    setupEventListeners() {
      if (this.prevBtn) {
        this.prevBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.prev());
      }
      if (this.nextBtn) {
        this.nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.next());
      }

      this.track.addEventListener('mousedown', this.touchStart.bind(this));
      this.track.addEventListener('touchstart', this.touchStart.bind(this));
      this.track.addEventListener('mouseup', this.touchEnd.bind(this));
      this.track.addEventListener('touchend', this.touchEnd.bind(this));
      this.track.addEventListener('mousemove', this.touchMove.bind(this));
      this.track.addEventListener('touchmove', this.touchMove.bind(this));
      this.track.addEventListener('mouseleave', this.touchEnd.bind(this));
    }

    touchStart(event) {
      this.isDragging = true;
      this.startPos = this.getPositionX(event);
      this.animationID = requestAnimationFrame(this.animation.bind(this));
      this.track.style.cursor = 'grabbing';
    }

    touchMove(event) {
      if (this.isDragging) {
        const currentPosition = this.getPositionX(event);
        this.currentTranslate = this.prevTranslate + currentPosition - this.startPos;
      }
    }

    touchEnd() {
      this.isDragging = false;
      cancelAnimationFrame(this.animationID);
      
      const movedBy = this.currentTranslate - this.prevTranslate;
      
      if (movedBy < -50 && this.currentIndex < this.totalSlides - 1) {
        this.currentIndex += 1;
      }
      
      if (movedBy > 50 && this.currentIndex > 0) {
        this.currentIndex -= 1;
      }
      
      this.updateCarousel();
      this.track.style.cursor = 'grab';
    }

    getPositionX(event) {
      return event.type.includes('mouse') ? event.pageX : event.touches[0].clientX;
    }

    animation() {
      if (this.isDragging) {
        this.track.style.transform = `translateX(${this.currentTranslate}px)`;
        requestAnimationFrame(this.animation.bind(this));
      }
    }

    prev() {
      if (this.currentIndex > 0) {
        this.currentIndex--;
      } else {
        this.currentIndex = this.totalSlides - 1;
      }
      this.updateCarousel();
    }

    next() {
      if (this.currentIndex < this.totalSlides - 1) {
        this.currentIndex++;
      } else {
        this.currentIndex = 0;
      }
      this.updateCarousel();
    }

    goToSlide(index) {
      this.currentIndex = index;
      this.updateCarousel();
    }

    updateCarousel() {
      if (this.isMobile) {
        const cardWidth = this.cards[0].offsetWidth;
        const gap = {{ block.settings.gap_mobile }};
        const rowWidth = (cardWidth * 2) + gap;
        const offset = -this.currentIndex * (rowWidth + gap) * 2;
        this.track.style.transform = `translateX(${offset}px)`;
        this.prevTranslate = offset;
        this.currentTranslate = offset;
      } else {
        const cardWidth = this.cards[0].offsetWidth;
        const gap = {{ block.settings.gap_desktop }};
        const offset = -this.currentIndex * (cardWidth + gap);
        this.track.style.transform = `translateX(${offset}px)`;
        this.prevTranslate = offset;
        this.currentTranslate = offset;
      }

      if (this.pagination) {
        const dots = this.pagination.querySelectorAll('.ai-shape-carousel__dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
          if (index === this.currentIndex) {
            dot.classList.add('active');
          } else {
            dot.classList.remove('active');
          }
        });
      }
    }
  }

  customElements.define('shape-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', ShapeCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Shape carousel",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "heading_font",
      "label": "Font",
      "default": "assistant_n4"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_font_size",
      "label": "Font size",
      "min": 16,
      "max": 72,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_letter_spacing",
      "label": "Letter spacing",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 5,
      "step": 0.5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_line_height",
      "label": "Line height",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 2,
      "step": 0.1,
      "default": 1.2
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "heading_color",
      "label": "Color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_margin_bottom",
      "label": "Margin bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Desktop card settings"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_width_desktop",
      "label": "Card width",
      "min": 100,
      "max": 400,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 200
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_height_desktop",
      "label": "Card height",
      "min": 100,
      "max": 500,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 250
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_size_desktop",
      "label": "Image size",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 400,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 180
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap_desktop",
      "label": "Gap between cards",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Mobile card settings"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_height_mobile",
      "label": "Card height",
      "min": 100,
      "max": 400,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 200
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_size_mobile",
      "label": "Image size",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 300,
